   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "07 DE-ROPE + ANIME CADENCE (NO SAM)\n\nSame as 06 without the character mask: simpler, no SAM2 needed. Requires matlowai/ComfyUI-MAINodes (the de-rope = the real fix for fast-motion smear/melting).\nPass 1: normal H3. MAINodes finds spans that move too fast for H3's 4-frame latent tokens, slows them, pass 2 redraws them; settings follow MAINodes' recommended fast flow (turbo LoRA 0.8, 8-step schedule, inject 0.5 = kept pass-1 acting in our tests). Exact Recover drops the extra frames, so pass 1's audio stays in sync. The de-rope is MAINodes' work, used unmodified. Our part: Anime Cadence holds the whole frame on 2s/3s.\nBest for shots with a mostly still camera; on big camera moves the camera also steps on 2s (use 06 for those). ~2x the time of a single render."
   ]
  }
